  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action builds on the previous two phases of the regional initiative, supported by the European Union (EU), the Regional Programme on Local Democracy in the Western Balkans (ReLOaD phase 1 and 2), implemented in 2017-2024 in Albania, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Kosovo, Montenegro, North Macedonia, and Serbia . It is based on the premise that a vibrant civil society is a crucial component of participatory democracy, facilitating citizen engagement in public affairs. This active participation plays</narrative>
